    <string name="settings_lock_on_wifi_disconnect_desc">The PC locks your session once it no longer sees this phone on Wi-Fi: out of range, Wi-Fi off, flat battery…</string>
    <string name="settings_lock_on_bluetooth">Lock when the PC loses Bluetooth</string>
    <string name="settings_lock_on_bluetooth_desc">The phone broadcasts a signed Bluetooth signal; the PC locks your session once it no longer picks it up (out of range, Bluetooth off…). The PC\'s Bluetooth must be on.</string>
